            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Debbie H"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good and very easy. I expected it to have more cranberry flavor, though. The cinnamon and cloves gives it more of an apple cider taste. I did use more cloves than called for, however. That may have overpowered the cranberry. Next time, I'll stick to the original recipe."
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "SKYQUEEN"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I have been making this identical recipe for over 30 yrs! It's a Christmas tradition, house smells wonderful while it perks. I have the old West Bend 30-Cup percolator and it's used ONLY for this, the pot has never seen Coffee! It's a great recipe, although a bit sweet, I reduce sugar to 3/4C. Try it, you won't be disappointed!",
            "datePublished": "2022-11-10T05:28:39.632Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Minda Chow"
            },
            "reviewBody": "it is as good as they say it is. Served this punch at a church Ladies Christmas gathering. Every one wanted to the recipe to make for their own events. I did not have a percolator, so I threw the ingredients in a crockpot, with the cloves wrapped in cheesecloth. The longer it sat in the crockpot, the better the flavor. Thanks for sharing.",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-20T19:46:59.310Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Laura Couch Strebler"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my family's favorite Christmas drink recipe! Smells wonderful and tastes great with fudge. It gets super hot in the percolator, so let it cool a bit before serving.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-24T08:24:52.107Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
