              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Jeanie"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this for Thanksgiving and thought it was very good. It made my house smell awesome, too.",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-20T16:23:59.373Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "CALJAKE"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for a faculty holiday coffee...fit perfectly in my 35 cup Melita urn. Put the sugar, spices and salt into a cheese cloth and placed into the percolator basket, though I'm sure lining it with paper filters would have worked. Punch was festive without being too sweet. A great alternative to mulled cider!",
            "datePublished": "2010-12-11T15:47:25.147Z"
          }
